sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Folio as Folio / WebSocket
    participant Chat as ChatHandler
    participant State as Redis Generation State
    participant Transport as RedisResearchHarnessTransport
    participant Streams as Redis Streams
    participant Worker as Python Worker
    participant Agent as Agents SDK Runtime
    participant Corpus as Java Corpus API
    participant Qdrant
    participant MySQL
    participant Model as MiniMax

    User->>Folio: send question
    Folio->>Chat: WebSocket chat command
    Chat->>MySQL: authorize conversation + lock paper scope
    Chat->>State: create STREAMING generation
    Chat-->>Folio: generation_start
    Chat->>Transport: submit ProductTurnRequest
    Transport->>Transport: queue check + reserve quota
    Transport->>Streams: XADD job
    Streams->>Worker: consumer group claims job
    Worker->>Worker: acquire and renew generation lock
    Worker->>Agent: run research turn
    loop model and tool loop
        Agent->>Model: model request
        Model-->>Agent: tool call
        Agent->>Corpus: discover / search / exact read
        Corpus->>Qdrant: hybrid candidate search
        Qdrant-->>Corpus: candidate locations + bounded payloads
        Corpus->>MySQL: reauthorize + validate Current Model
        alt PASSAGE / TABLE / FIGURE
            Corpus->>Corpus: validate cached Qdrant payload hash + span
        else PAGE / SECTION
            Corpus->>MySQL: read canonical structure text
        end
        Corpus-->>Agent: preview or Source Quote
        Agent->>Streams: progress event
        Streams-->>Transport: event
        Transport-->>Chat: progressListener
        Chat-->>Folio: WebSocket progress
    end
    Agent-->>Worker: validated ProductTurnResult
    Worker->>Streams: terminal event + XACK + XDEL
    Streams-->>Transport: result
    Transport-->>Chat: future completed
    Chat->>MySQL: save answer + references
    Chat->>State: mark COMPLETED
    Chat-->>Folio: answer + completion
